OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEarly
OL,6,Fevening sunny spells will soon give
OL,7,Fway to wet and breezy conditions as a
OL,8,Fband of rain, occasionally heavy,
OL,9,Fmoves southeastwards. Drier conditions
OL,10,Fmay develop into northwestern areas
OL,11,Ftowards dawn, along with clear spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FEarly rain soon clearing to
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Mostly dry in the
OL,15,Fmorning but some scattered showers,
OL,16,Foccasionally heavy, slowly spreading
OL,17,Fsoutheastwards during the afternoon.
OL,18,FFeeling fresh in the wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
